			"notes": "Yep, already a new release, I am productive this time\n\nWhat's new?\n- A FUKING **AUTO UPDATE** LET'S GOOOO. I don't really know why no mods haven't this. It's always annoying to have to download the mod, moving it in the right directory and relaunching minecraft... Everythings will be done when you are launching the game, no need to restart it, just, play. But if you don't want this, you can disable it in the settings\n- I added click sound to the color picker\n- I rework the look of the config gui, a lot cleaner to me\n\nOh, btw, there is a version for minecraft **1.12.2**\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/CPSDisplay/cpsdisplay/compare/2.1.2...2.2.0"
